Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:33:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ROMFSARC: read RomFS shard archives

A synthetic @romfsarc: host path, an archive MountRom, archive file handles, and directory snapshots from the index,
plus the reader (romfs_arc.c) and its packer (romfs_arc.py).

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Legacy ROMFSARC shard archives (Tears of the Kingdom, 300k files) that players already made; upstream reads DMROMFS1 images instead. Kept so existing archives keep loading; retire when none are left
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#123
